  "page_idiograph.ai_warn.many_researchers_trying_ai": "Many researchers are trying AI in their work, and guidance on acknowledging and crediting it in research is still forming, so check what your university, your ethics committee and your journals say now. AI makes mistakes, invents facts and can lend false confidence to a reading.",
  "page_idiograph.ai_warn.these_features_passages_ask": "With these features on, the passages you ask about are sent to the AI provider you choose. Make sure you have permission for this under your consent forms, data protection (GDPR) and your university's and journals' rules. It deserves careful consideration and a conversation with your supervisor or colleagues. These features are experimental and not for a study's real analysis. The advice is to keep them off unless you are researching AI in qualitative research. They are there to suggest and to help you think, never to do the thinking or the work that is yours as the analyst.",
